Description: SupraLINUX Aurora global theme
 Plasma look-and-feel, color schemes, Plasma style, SDDM theme, sound theme
 and GTK defaults for SupraLINUX Aurora. Includes the SupraLINUX Dark and
 SupraLINUX Light icon themes derived from Breeze; cursors remain Breeze.
